# playwright e2e auth state — the web suite's saved `storageState`
# (`packages/apps/commise/web/.auth/<run-key>.json`, written by `tests/e2e/auth.setup.ts`).
#
# ⛔ NEVER COMMIT ONE. The file is not a cache: it holds a LIVE Clerk session — the session cookie plus the
# dev-browser token — so committing it publishes working credentials for a signed-in user of the shared
# sandbox Clerk instance. Matched as a bare directory name so it holds wherever a suite writes one.
#
# (`e2e/web/.auth/` used to be listed here; no such path has ever existed in this repo — it came in with the
# V-Model scaffolding. Replaced rather than kept, so the rule matches the directory that is actually written.)
.auth/

